## Cohesion Audit: `src/blog/people/drafts/Cara-Delevingne.md`

### Central Thesis
Delevingne is a Type 4, not the Type 7 the crowd databases assigned, because for twenty-three years she could not say what was wrong and her body, her career switches, and now her album are all the same request to be seen accurately.

